    {
      "id": "performing-in-real-time",
      "revision": 1,
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
      "title": "Performing in Real Time",
      "subtitle": "为什么即时表现让人紧张，而反复修改让人安心？从唱歌、考试和写作谈起，思考如何练习临场应对。",
      "sourceNote": "根据提供的英文转写校对，保留口语中的停顿；未核对原视频。",
      "duration": 66.168,
      "voice": "美式女声 · Jenny",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p01",
          "text": "I guess people who don't have much experience with real-time competition tend to get nervous pretty easily. Like me, I struggle to stay calm under pressure.",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "performing-in-real-time-01.mp3",
            "sha256": "e291367f5f8f31ecaad0b6300271b7a7fbb173ee1992827789e41d3eae8153c1"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "competition",
              "ipa": "ˌkɑmpəˈtɪʃən",
              "meaning": "竞争；比赛"
            },
            {
              "word": "tend to",
              "ipa": "tɛnd tə",
              "meaning": "往往会；倾向于"
            },
            {
              "word": "under pressure",
              "ipa": "ˈʌndɚ ˈprɛʃɚ",
              "meaning": "在压力之下"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p02",
          "text": "When it comes to things that happen in real time... By that, I mean things like singing. You've only got maybe three minutes, and every second counts.",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "performing-in-real-time-02.mp3",
            "sha256": "e1a592b8393eb4176ba4b58e682341f2e634eb050a3554d83efdff4beb16d0cf"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "in real time",
              "ipa": "ɪn ˈriːəl taɪm",
              "meaning": "实时地；当场"
            },
            {
              "word": "every second counts",
              "ipa": "ˈɛvri ˈsɛkənd kaʊnts",
              "meaning": "每一秒都很重要；分秒必争"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p03",
          "text": "Whatever you deliver in that moment is what people get. There's no going back to change your work or fix things afterward.",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "performing-in-real-time-03.mp3",
            "sha256": "469e9667651f0e903fb1e6515d42553e126b11afd3af35ceb1973c78ddb4d974"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "deliver",
              "ipa": "dɪˈlɪvɚ",
              "meaning": "这里指呈现、展现（当场的表现）"
            },
            {
              "word": "afterward",
              "ipa": "ˈæftɚwɚd",
              "meaning": "之后；事后"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p04",
          "text": "And I'm a total mess when it comes to things like that.",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "performing-in-real-time-04.mp3",
            "sha256": "c72ec3a0cc8763b81c605ca31ca4bc51dafa7cdceed910c8b6b8f35f465a2f9e"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "a total mess",
              "ipa": "ə ˈtoʊtəl mɛs",
              "meaning": "一团糟；这里形容自己紧张失措"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p05",
